    "src/melee/ty/tydisplay.c: Removed in 308c09746c — the toy.h prototype is used as-is; the local declaration turned out to be residue with no codegen effect (function stays 100%).",
    "src/melee/ty/tyfigupon.c: Agreed and fixed in 308c09746c — `strings + 0x4EC` was exactly `&_tyFigupon_803FEEFC` (already defined in this TU), so both sites now reference the camera desc directly and the offset trick is gone. Byte-identical."
